# Pocket — Product Requirements Document (PRD)

Version 1.0 · Android · Offline-first · Personal use · No backend

Pocket is a minimalist personal finance app for Android that lets one person track income, expenses, multiple wallets, transfers, monthly spending, and loans — entirely on their own device, without an account or internet connection.

The product principle is simple: know where your money is, where it goes, and what you owe — without turning money tracking into a chore.

