## 1. Product overview

Multiple wallets

Cash, bKash, Nagad, Rocket, bank accounts, Metro Rapid Pass, and custom wallets — each with its own balance.

Complete money tracking

Record income, expenses, wallet transfers, transfer fees, lending, borrowing, repayments, and settlements.

Monthly insights

Income versus expenses, category breakdowns, wallet balances, monthly statements, and searchable history.

Private and offline

No sign-in, no cloud account, no required internet access, and local backup/import for changing phones.

### Product constraints

